    {
      "id": "claim_bb602964ed9047c895ec8b7096bc1ce4",
      "statement": "The repository is a Bun monorepo (workspace scope @ji) for Catapulze Job Intelligence that collects job vacancies from ~23 Dutch sources, normalises, deduplicates, makes them searchable with Boolean queries plus facets, and exports the approved subset idempotently to Spott.io after human approval; it is agent-native with REST, tRPC, and MCP on the same capability surface.",
      "evidence": [
